sequenceDiagram
  actor Analyst
  participant Revision
  participant Bridge as Analysis bridge
  participant Engine as Estimator in civiqhub-selene
  participant Result
  Analyst->>Revision: regime()
  Revision->>Bridge: regime(revision)
  Bridge->>Revision: tally
  Revision-->>Bridge: five counts
  Bridge->>Engine: fit(counts, subject = revision id)
  Engine->>Engine: check input, record provenance
  alt no vote
    Engine-->>Bridge: Result without value, reason no_votes, with provenance
  else at least one vote
    Engine->>Engine: compute index, contributions, median, label, margin
    Engine-->>Bridge: Result with value and provenance, uncertainty = None
  end
  Bridge-->>Analyst: reading with its citation
  Analyst->>Result: uncertainty
  Result-->>Analyst: None
